sequenceDiagram
    participant E as lyrion (Emacs)
    participant L as LMS
    participant S as squeezelite
    participant Q as Qobuz

    E->>L: search (CLI, 9090)
    L->>Q: search (Qobuz API)
    Q-->>L: results
    L-->>E: results, in Qobuz's order
    E->>L: play a release (CLI, 9090)
    L->>Q: ask for the track's stream (Qobuz API)
    Q-->>L: a signed address on Qobuz's CDN
    L->>S: start streaming from that address (SlimProto, 3483)
    S->>Q: request the audio (HTTPS)
    Q-->>S: audio, straight from the CDN
    S->>L: track started (SlimProto, 3483)
    L-->>E: status (CLI, 9090)
    E->>L: request the cover (HTTP, 9000, image proxy)
    L->>Q: fetch the cover (HTTPS)
    Q-->>L: image
    L-->>E: cover image
